  "A 7-day longevity plan (strength days, interval days, a mobility day, Norwegian 4×4, a light day). On X: 4 min all-out, 4 min rest, four times.": "7 天长寿计划（力量日、间歇日、活动度日、挪威 4×4、轻松日）。他在 X 上的版本是 4 分钟全力、4 分钟休息，做四轮。",
  "A band picker on band exercises, with the six FitBeast colours and their resistance ranges, plus a custom value. It sits on the same row as reps and weight.": "用于带练习的带选择器，具有六种 FitBeast 颜色及其阻力范围，以及自定义值。它与次数和重量位于同一行。",
  "A block figure with pixel-art clothes and equipment, standing on grass.": "站在草地上的方块人物，穿着像素风服装、拿着像素风器械。",
  "A brightly coloured cartoon with thick black outlines. Working muscles have yellow outlines.": "色彩鲜艳、黑色粗描边的卡通人物。发力肌肉用黄色描边。",
  "A brush-painted figure on rice paper with a circular head and fading ink trails. Red washes show the working muscles.": "宣纸上的毛笔画人物，圆头，墨迹渐淡。红色晕染标出发力肌肉。",
  "A cartoon athlete with tied-back hair, a turquoise training top and violet leggings. Hands grip equipment and plant on the floor.": "扎着头发的卡通运动员，穿青绿色训练上衣和紫色紧身裤。双手握住器械或撑地。",
  "A carved ink figure against a vermilion sun, with paper grain, gouged lines and uneven edges. Working muscles use ochre ink.": "朱红太阳前的刻墨人物，带纸纹、刻线和毛边。发力肌肉用赭色墨。",
  "A clockwork constellation with planets for joints, orbiting moons and a sun in the chest. Brass rods turn coral where muscles work.": "发条星座：行星作关节，卫星环绕，胸口有一轮太阳。发力处黄铜杆变成珊瑚色。",
  "A Coach popup beside Radio, with a one-time model download and offline speech afterwards.": "广播旁边有一个教练弹出窗口，随后提供一次性模型下载和离线演讲。",
  "A dark background, the exercise on the left and navigation on the right.": "深色背景，左侧动作、右侧导航。",
  "A figure cut from folded paper, with soft shadows and coral pieces showing the working muscles.": "折纸剪成的人物，带柔和阴影，珊瑚色纸片标出发力肌肉。",
  "A figure made from text on a glowing green screen, with a floor grid and amber working muscles.": "发光绿屏上的文字组成的人物，带地面网格，发力肌肉为琥珀色。",
  "A foldable slant board (about 40 × 40 cm) or 2.5–5 kg plates under the heels: squats and Poliquin step-ups.": "可折叠斜板（约 40 × 40 厘米），或在脚跟下垫 2.5–5 公斤杠铃片：用于深蹲和 Poliquin 上台阶。",
  "A fuzzy monster in oversized trainers. Its googly eyes bounce as it moves.": "穿超大运动鞋的毛绒怪物，动起来时大眼睛会弹跳。",
  "A heavy sofa or bed you can hook your heels under, or a door Nordic strap.": "能把脚跟勾住的厚重沙发或床，或门上的北欧训练带。",
  "A joint hurts": "关节疼痛",
  "a jump in between sets": "组间跳跃",
  "A jump in between sets": "组间跳跃",
  "A large exercise demonstration on the left, with the workout beside it.": "左侧大幅动作演示，旁边是训练内容。",
  "A level check in Progress using the plan's move-up checkpoints, a prompt when they are met, and a step-down reminder after a long break.": "使用计划的升级检查点进行进度检查，满足检查点时进行提示，并在长时间休息后进行降级提醒。",
  "A moving comic figure with newsprint dots and bold ink outlines. Working muscles are vermilion.": "带报纸网点、粗墨线的动态漫画人物。发力肌肉为朱红色。",
  "A native coach voice for every translated language, built by the translated-voice workflow.": "由翻译语音工作流程构建的针对每种翻译语言的母语教练语音。",
  "A next-time suggestion on every strength exercise (repeat, add weight after two sessions at the top of the rep range, or add a rep) with a button to fill it in.": "每次力量训练的下一次建议（重复、在两次训练后在次数范围的顶部增加重量，或添加一次次数），并带有一个按钮来填写。",
  "A person in a T-shirt, shorts and trainers, lit by soft studio light.": "穿 T 恤、短裤和运动鞋的人，柔和棚灯照明。",
  "A playing video stops when you switch to another exercise or another guided tab.": "当您切换到另一个练习或另一个引导选项卡时，正在播放的视频会停止。",
  "A Pocket Full of Exercise": "装满运动的口袋",
  "A quick mute button beside Radio in guided workouts. It mutes the stream without changing the volume and lights up while the sound is off.": "在指导训练中，收音机旁边有一个快速静音按钮。它会在不改变音量的情况下使流静音，并在声音关闭时亮起。",
  "A repeatable GitHub build creates shared audio packs for all five voices and all four training levels.": "可重复的 GitHub 构建为所有五个语音和所有四个训练级别创建共享音频包。",
  "A robot with ceramic armour, visible joints and a glowing visor. Amber panels show the working muscles.": "陶瓷装甲机器人，关节外露，面罩发光。琥珀色面板标出发力肌肉。",
  "A second weekly scoreboard: one against the targets for your level, one against Bryan's full Well trained week.": "第二个每周记分板：一个针对你的级别目标，一个针对Bryan训练有素的一周。",
  "A small Bryan hint beside the Videos tab when the exercise has a Bryan video.": "当练习有 Bryan 视频时，“视频”选项卡旁边会出现一个 Bryan 小提示。",
  "A smooth grey figure with lights showing which muscles are working.": "光滑的灰色人物，用灯光显示发力肌肉。",
  "A stable low step for cardio, strength step-ups and calf raises. Start at the lowest secure height. Progress with control or dumbbells; never stack furniture.": "稳固的低台阶，用于有氧、力量上台阶和提踵。从最低的稳固高度开始。先用控制进阶，再加哑铃；绝不要叠家具。",
  "A standard physiotherapy drill for forward head posture. It is an extra in this posture block and is not one of Bryan’s exercises.": "针对头前倾的标准理疗动作。它是这个体态模块的额外内容，不属于 Bryan 的动作。",
  "A standard stretch for tight chest muscles that pull the shoulders forward. It is an extra in this posture block and is not one of Bryan’s exercises.": "针对紧张胸肌导致圆肩的标准拉伸。它是这个体态模块的额外内容，不属于 Bryan 的动作。",
  "A technical drawing with live joint angles, centre lines and hatched working muscles. Labels name the exercise and show equipment dimensions.": "带实时关节角度、中心线和斜线发力肌肉的工程图。标签标出动作名称和器械尺寸。",
  "A theme step in the first-run setup, and a theme picker in Settings → Appearance; the look changes as you click.": "首次运行设置中的主题步骤，以及设置 → 外观中的主题选择器；单击时外观会发生变化。",
  "A three-column grid with ruled lines and compact numbers.": "带横线的三栏网格和紧凑数字。",
  "A Where to look: min X sec Y timestamp banner appears above every video so you always know where the exercise starts, even if a player resets or can't embed at a timestamp.": "A 在哪里看：分钟 X 秒 Y 时间戳横幅出现在每个视频上方，因此你始终知道练习从哪里开始，即使播放器重置或无法嵌入时间戳。",
  "A white sports sign figure on a blue tile. Orange bars show which muscles are working.": "蓝色底上的白色体育标识人物。橙色条显示发力肌肉。",
  "A wobbly pen drawing on notebook paper, with sweat drops and comments about the exercise. Highlighter marks the working muscles.": "笔记本纸上的手绘涂鸦，带汗滴和动作点评。荧光笔标出发力肌肉。",
