  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan 在 2 区步行和徒步时穿负重背心，安全增加轴向骨负荷。",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan 说手机是毁体态的头号元凶。把手机举到与眼睛齐平，显示器顶部也要与眼睛齐平。",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan 说这个动作很讲究技术，是为他自己的诊断情况学的。动作要轻；出现头晕、刺痛或头痛就停止。",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Bryan 演示（含时间戳）",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan 在 {time}（{clock}）演示",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan 在 2023 年做 1 × 10。他 2025 年 Galpin 训练的力量模块包含北欧腿后肌弯举，可预防腿后肌拉伤。",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan 用弹力带做“蝴蝶拉”，1 × 15。多数文章把它描述为弹力带夹胸；看他的视频照做。",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan 每条腿做 3 × 10，师从 Ben Patrick——与他合作 2026 扣篮项目的膝过脚尖教练。这个动作强化股四头肌内侧（VMO）和膝盖韧性。",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan同时进行两种握法",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan 两种都做。他 2025 年 Galpin 训练在力量模块以 2 × 5–8 加入；官方初学者清单使用辅助引体。",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan 在 2025 年与 Andy Galpin 博士的训练中做帕洛夫推。它训练躯干抵抗旋转。",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan 做胫骨前肌抬举（1 × 25，他的清单中为单腿）。他 2026 年的扣篮笔记提到踝关节背屈受限。这个动作就是练这个。",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan 从 2026 年 7 月起在 49 岁练扣篮，做大重量举重并在组间加入跳跃。他说自己需要更多快肌纤维和更快的发力速度，并提醒落地冲击带来的跟腱风险。先学会落地，再练高度。",
