  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Bryan Johnson 的零抽血居家体能测试组合。用精英 18 岁标准和长寿百分位跟踪你的功能生物标志物。",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan 把握力作为主要长寿生物标志物（约 60 公斤，所有年龄段前 5%）。悬垂能给脊柱减压，并增强前臂握力耐力。",
