  "Bryan opens his workouts with a backward sled drag (about 2 min in his 2023 routine, still first in his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin). It works the knees and quads using the Knees-Over-Toes approach.": "Bryan 用倒拉雪橇开场（2023 年训练约 2 分钟，2025 年与 Andy Galpin 博士的热身仍排第一）。它用膝过脚尖方法练膝盖和股四头肌。",
  "Bryan puts injury prevention first. If a joint hurts, open the exercise and switch to its easier version.": "Bryan 把预防受伤放在第一位。关节疼痛时，打开动作并换成轻松版。",
  "Bryan shared this tip in April 2026 for days spent sitting. In the study he cited, squat breaks improved blood sugar more than one 30-minute walk. He stressed taking breaks from sitting.": "Bryan 在 2026 年 4 月分享了久坐日的这个技巧。他引用的研究显示，深蹲休息对血糖的改善比一次 30 分钟步行更好。他强调要经常起身。",
  "Bryan spends weekends hiking, biking, climbing or playing pickleball at an easy pace. Your indoor session combines controlled vigorous cardio at your level, a long Zone 2 block and 20 min of stretching. This is the second posture strength day.": "Bryan 周末会轻松徒步、骑车、攀岩或打匹克球。你的室内训练包括适合你级别的可控高强度有氧、较长的 2 区训练和 20 分钟拉伸。这是第二个体态力量日。",
  "Bryan targets at least 75 min of high-intensity cardio a week, with only about 10 min near maximum effort. This home block supplies controlled vigorous minutes alongside his Tuesday bursts and Thursday 4×4; its duration is set for this home plan and differs from the sessions in his sample week.": "Bryan 的目标是每周至少 75 分钟高强度有氧，其中只有约 10 分钟接近极限。这个居家模块配合周二冲刺和周四 4×4，提供可控高强度分钟；时长按居家计划设定，与他示例周中的训练不同。",
  "Bryan tests ~60 kg (top 5% across all ages). Handgrip strength is a primary biological age biomarker in clinical longevity literature.": "Bryan 测试约 60 公斤（所有年龄段前 5%）。在临床长寿研究中，握力是主要的生物学年龄生物标志物。",
  "Bryan tests at ~64 ml/kg/min (top 1% 18yo). Cardiovascular fitness is the single strongest statistical predictor of longevity.": "Bryan 测试约 64 毫升/公斤/分钟（18 岁人群前 1%）。心肺适能是长寿最强的统计预测指标。",
  "Bryan trains obliques for 1 × 25: on the hyperextension bench in 2023, as oblique side bends in his 2025 conditioning block.": "Bryan 用 1 × 25 练腹斜肌：2023 年在罗马椅侧屈，2025 年体能模块中做腹斜肌侧屈。",
