  "Choose a theme from these Today screenshots. Each shows a different exercise and animation style; you can choose your animation style below.": "从这些今日屏幕截图中选择一个主题。每个都展示了不同的练习和动画风格；你可以在下面选择你的动画风格。",
  "Choose a theme to try its layout, fonts and colours. The screenshots show different animation styles; choose yours later in Settings. You can change either choice any time.": "选择主题，试试它的布局、字体和配色。截图展示了不同的动画风格；之后可在设置里选择。两项选择随时都能改。",
