  "Start with a few minutes of easy movement, then dynamic exercises, as in Bryan’s official warm-up. Hops and balance come from his bone protocol and five exercise pillars.": "先做几分钟轻松活动，再做动态动作，就像 Bryan 的官方热身。跳跃和平衡来自他的骨骼方案和五大训练支柱。",
  "Start with a small range of motion and increase it each week.": "先从小幅度开始，每周增加一点。",
  "Start with feet lightly supported if needed. Alternate between relaxing into a passive hang (spine decompression) and engaging the active hang (shoulders pulled down).": "需要时让双脚轻触地面支撑。在放松的被动悬垂（脊柱减压）和用力的主动悬垂（肩膀下压）之间交替。",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps.": "从有支撑的动作、1–2 组和轻重量开始，不做跳跃。",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps. Effort 4–5 out of 10: stop each set with 5 or more easy reps left.": "从有支撑的动作、1–2 组和轻重量开始，不做跳跃。用力程度 4–5/10：每组结束时还能轻松做 5 次以上。",
