  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "力量日采用模板的基础动作（深蹲、俯卧撑、划船、摆荡、弓步、推举、上台阶、搬运、平板支撑），并加入他标志性的膝过脚尖和高次数体态训练。",
  "Strength includes lunges, overhead and floor presses, step-ups, swings and carries alongside his signature exercises.": "力量包括弓步、过头推举和地板推举、上台阶、摆动和负重以及他的标志性练习。",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri with progressive overload, short intervals Tue, Norwegian 4×4 Thu (start with 2–3 rounds, hard but controlled), easy outdoor or social activity Sat, recovery Sun. At least 150 min Zone 2 and 75 min hard cardio, about 10 of them near max.": "周一/周三/周五力量训练，渐进超负荷；周二短间歇；周四挪威 4×4（从 2–3 轮开始，吃力但受控）；周六轻松户外或社交活动；周日恢复。每周至少 150 分钟 2 区和 75 分钟高强度有氧，其中约 10 分钟接近极限。",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri, short intervals Tue and Norwegian 4×4 Thu follow Bryan’s template. Saturday adds controlled vigorous work to the indoor Zone 2 session to meet his weekly totals.": "周一/周三/周五力量，周二短间歇，周四挪威 4×4，遵循 Bryan 的模板。周六在室内 2 区训练中加入可控高强度，以完成每周总量。",
