  "Three demonstration videos for every exercise: two technique videos and one short, focused clip. When Bryan has a video it still opens first and stays the default.": "每个练习三个演示视频：两个技术视频和一个简短的重点剪辑。当 Bryan 有视频时，它仍然首先打开并保持默认状态。",
  "Thu": "星期四",
  "Thursday": "周四",
  "Thursday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 4 rounds of 4 min at 85–95% of max heart rate with 3 min at 60–70% between, at a hard, controlled pace below an all-out sprint, starting with 2–3 rounds if four is too much. Bryan’s own variant (X, Dec 2024) is 4 min all-out with 4 min rest.": "Bryan 最新每周模板的周四（训练通讯，2026 年 10 月 4 日）：4 轮 4 分钟，心率 85–95%，中间 3 分钟 60–70%，配速吃力但受控，低于全力冲刺；四轮太多就先做 2–3 轮。他自己的版本（X，2024 年 12 月）是 4 分钟全力、4 分钟休息。",
  "Thursday, October 1": "10 月 1 日，星期四",
