  "Thursday's hard 4×4 intervals at Well trained. Other levels use a lower target.": "训练有素级别周四的高强度 4×4 间歇。其他级别使用较低目标。",
  "Thursday’s hard 4×4 intervals at Well trained. Other levels use a lower target.": "周四在 Well Training 进行高强度 4×4 间歇训练。其他级别使用较低的目标。",
