  "Today puts Swap session before Skip day and styles the session picker for each theme.": "今天将交换训练放在跳过日之前，并为每个主题设置训练选择器的样式。",
  "Today shows a weekly-targets chip that links to the scoreboard, and Settings links to the level check.": "今天展示了一个链接到记分板的每周目标筹码，以及链接到级别检查的“设置”。",
  "Today uses the same inline timer instead of opening a separate timer window. The Timer button beside Minutes and intervals is a little larger.": "今天使用相同的内联计时器而不是打开单独的计时器窗口。分钟和间隔旁边的计时器按钮稍大一些。",
  "Today, This week, the guided workout, Progress, the exercise pages and The plan show your level instead of a phase; The plan and each exercise compare all four levels.": "今天、本周、引导训练、进度、动作页面和计划都显示级别，而不是阶段；计划和每个动作会对比全部四个级别。",
