  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "周一、周三、周五练力量，周二做短间歇，周四做挪威 4×4，周六做混合有氧。周日休息。2 区和可控高强度训练帮助你接近 Bryan Johnson 的每周有氧目标。他的公开方案在这里改编为自重、可调哑铃、引体向上杆和弹力带版本。",
