  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "周二：20 秒轻快冲刺，恢复时间拉长。周四：2 轮 3 分钟受控训练，逐步增至 3 轮。",
